  "ruleText": "Den 101.36 “Volunteer” means an individual who provides dental care without pay or compensation for work or service performed.\n\nSource. #8224, eff 12-8-04; renumbered by #12427 (formerly Den 101.26); renumbered by #14140 (formerly Den 101.31)",
